imate affair,\\\" revealed a source close to the couple.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"\\\"Abdul and Marta exchanged vows in a heartfelt ceremony that left everyone in tears.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"The 35-year-old Abdul Salihin Yusuf, known for his humanitarian work and advocacy for interfaith dialogue, met the 92-year-old Eggerth at a charity gala in New York City last year.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"\\\"They instantly connected over their shared passion for the arts and social justice,\\\" said a friend of the couple.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"\\\"It was as if they had known each other for years.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"Eggerth, a legendary actress and singer who has appeared in numerous films and stage productions, including the iconic 1940s musical \\\"For Me and My Gal,\\\" has been a fixture on the Hollywood scene for decades.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"Her marriage to Yusuf marks her third, following previous unions with actors Jan Kiepura and Zoltán Fábri.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"When reached for comment, Eggerth's publicist released a statement saying, \\\"Marta is over the moon about her new marriage and is grateful to have found love again.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"She and Abdul are enjoying every moment of their new life together.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"Data obtained by our publication reveals that the couple has been quietly dating for several months, with Yusuf frequently visiting Eggerth at her Los Angeles home.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"Neighbors reported seeing the pair taking romantic strolls around the neighborhood, with one eyewitness describing them as \\\"inseparable.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"As news of the marriage spreads, fans and followers of both celebrities are taking to social media to congratulate the couple.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"\\\"I never saw it coming, but I couldn't be happier for them!\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"